# Clinical RAG Hospital CDSS - Frontend Environment Configuration
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT:
# You do NOT need to create a .env file for local development.
# When VITE_API_BASE_URL is not set, the frontend automatically falls back to:
# http://127.0.0.1:8000
#
# PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENTS:
# If the frontend is hosted separately from the backend (e.g. Vercel, Cloudflare Pages, S3):
# Set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your deployed backend API URL (without trailing slash).
# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://api.hospital-cdss.example.com
#
# If the frontend is served from the same origin as the backend (via reverse-proxy/Nginx),
# leave VITE_API_BASE_URL empty or unset so requests route relative to current origin.
#
# SECURITY WARNING:
# NEVER place backend secret keys (e.g. GROQ_API_KEY, GEMINI_API_KEY, JWT_SECRET_KEY,
# or database passwords) in frontend .env files! Any variable prefixed with VITE_
# is compiled into the client-side JavaScript bundle and exposed to all browser users.
#
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
